pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 48, 400, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: "02 — THE GAP"
  - elementId: claim
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 84, 800, 46]
    content:
      style: "$claim"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Usage dashboards measure <span style="color:$warn">how much</span> AI is used.</p>
  - elementId: claim2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 136, 800, 46]
    content:
      fontSize: 30
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Nothing tells an engineer what to do next.</p>
  - elementId: col1-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 210, 360, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$dim"
      letterSpacing: 2
      wrap: false
      text: WHAT TEAMS SEE TODAY
  - elementId: col1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 242, 360, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <ul><li>License seats and token counts</li><li>Who used which tool, how often</li><li>Charts that invite ranking people</li><li>Generic training, same for everyone</li></ul>
  - elementId: vline
    elementType: line
    bounds: [480, 210, 2, 165]
    viewBox: [2, 165]
    points: "1,0 1,165"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: col2-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 210, 360, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      letterSpacing: 2
      wrap: false
      text: WHAT TEAMS ACTUALLY NEED
  - elementId: col2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 242, 360, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      color: "$text"
      text: |
        <ul><li>Which workflow fits which task</li><li>Whether the AI output is correct</li><li>One evidence-backed next step, privately</li><li>Practices shared only as team patterns</li></ul>
  - elementId: sep
    elementType: line
    bounds: [80, 396, 800, 2]
    viewBox: [800, 2]
    points: "0,1 800,1"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: privacy
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 414, 800, 56]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>And there is a second problem: individual-level usage data creates a privacy trap. SPACE guidance — activity metrics must never be used alone to reward or penalize. When engineers fear evaluation, they hide real usage and coaching fails before it starts.</p>
  - elementId: pageno
    elementType: text
    bounds: [900, 500, 36, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: "03"
